dl-map-upload-title = Load grid
dl-map-upload-help = Choose a map or ship (.yml/.yaml), up to 20 MiB.
    Requires Mapping permission and ghost mode (regular ghost or adminghost).
    A translucent preview will appear, visible only to you.
    Transfers expire after 5 minutes without progress. Choosing a file has no time limit.
dl-map-upload-pick = Choose file
dl-map-upload-working = Choosing and uploading map…
dl-map-upload-progress = Received by server: { $percent }% ({ $received } / { $total } MiB).
dl-map-upload-spawning = File received. Preparing preview…
dl-map-upload-success = Grid placed.
dl-map-upload-preview = Only you can see the preview. Ctrl+arrows move it by 1 tile.
    Ctrl+Shift+arrows move it by 10 tiles. WASD moves your ghost.
    Hold MMB and drag horizontally to rotate.
    Click Place grid to confirm. Esc cancels.
    Placement expires after 5 minutes.
dl-map-upload-confirm = Place grid
dl-map-upload-cancel = Cancel placement
dl-map-upload-denied = Requires Mapping permission and a ghost on a map.
dl-map-upload-size = The file must be nonempty and no larger than 20 MiB.
dl-map-upload-busy = Another upload is in progress. Try again in a few seconds.
dl-map-upload-interrupted = The transfer was interrupted or timed out.
dl-map-upload-invalid = Could not load the map. Expected map YAML containing at least one grid.
dl-map-upload-read-error = Could not read the selected file.
dl-map-upload-cancelled = File selection cancelled.
